The image files in this folder (public/m06/specimens/) and the derived
cutouts in derived/ are photographs of real brains used in the Lab 6
identification game. They are used by permission or under their own licences,
listed below, and they are excluded from the GNU General Public License that
covers the rest of this repository. Nothing in this repository's LICENSE file
applies to them, and they are not to be treated as copyrighted by this
project. Copying them elsewhere means carrying their own credit and terms.

The originals are unaltered. The files in derived/ are made from them by
scripts/m06-specimens.py using only a crop, a threshold, a flood fill and a
conversion to grayscale — nothing is redrawn, and no generative editing of
any kind is used. Each derived file's name is an opaque hash so that no
species name reaches the page before the game's reveal; manifest.json maps
each to its original.

